historyofvideogamein4k-by-jean-yveslamoureux for Debian
-------------------------------------------------------

The orig tarball contains the upstream files (source, Makefile,
README.txt), with a resources/ folder added at packaging time (an
earlier desktop file and an empty icon). The files used by the package
are in debian/resources/.

The source file includes "s.h", which is not in the upstream archive:
debian/patches/01_adapt_makefile.patch adds it, with the SDL and libc
headers, and rewrites the Makefile to use the Debian build flags.

debian/patches/02_vsync-quit-fullscreen.patch enables V-Sync through
SDL12COMPAT_SYNC_TO_VBLANK (the pong moves one step per frame and lasted
a fraction of a second at more than 1000 frames per second), quits with
Escape or when the window is closed, and adds a --fullscreen option.

The icon is a frame of the "vroom" part, captured from the intro.

Written by Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>, reviewed by Nicolas HOUDELOT.

